/T (The STSV's adapted transportation service is a specialized, door-to-door public transit service that operates by reservation only. Reservations can be made at least four hours in advance. Users are admitted according to the eligibility criteria for adapted transportation established by the Ministry of Transport \(MTQ\), and their companions, if applicable, may also use this service. The STSV reserves the right to choose the vehicle for the trip \(regular vehicle, adapted vehicle, or minibus\), as this choice must take into account the user's limitations and the available transportation resources. )
/E (The STSV's adapted transportation service is a specialized, door-to-door public transit service that operates by reservation only. Reservations can be made at least four hours in advance. Users are admitted according to the eligibility criteria for adapted transportation established by the Ministry of Transport \(MTQ\), and their companions, if applicable, may also use this service. The STSV reserves the right to choose the vehicle for the trip \(regular vehicle, adapted vehicle, or minibus\), as this choice must take into account the user's limitations and the available transportation resources. )
