/E (No-shows, cancellations and emergencies  Users must call at least one \(1\) hour before the scheduled boarding time to cancel a reservation by contacting the STSV. A penalty of five \(5\) dollars is imposed for each no-show \(user not showing up for their trip without having cancelled\) within the same municipality and for trips between two municipalities served by the STSV, and fifteen \(15\) dollars for trips outside the service area. )
