284 0 obj
<<
/Title (Luggage and shopping bag  Luggage and shopping bags are permitted provided their handling does not require the driver's intervention. Luggage is also permitted as long as the space required does not reduce or occupy a space normally occupied by a passenger or a mobility device \(wheelchair, walker, etc.\).)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 312 0 R
/Next 233 0 R
>>
endobj
