/Title (1\) Inability to walk a distance of 400 meters on flat ground 2\) Inability to climb a step 35 centimeters high with support, or inability to descend one without support 3\) Inability to complete a journey using regular transportation due to extreme fatigue 4\) Inability to orient oneself in time or space 5\) Inability to control situations or behaviors that may be detrimental to one's own safety or that of others 6\) Inability to communicate verbally or gesturally; however, this inability alone cannot be considered for the purposes of admission.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
